  whisper: {fileID: 0}
  goHome: Go home - Flat 2B, second floor
  findDerek: Find Derek
  checkTape: Check the camera footage - the PC in the living room
  chase: Chase him
  timeCard: SATURDAY  -  7:12 AM
  arriveLines: Van's back. Clocked out. Twelve hours on the road.|Left my car keys
    in my desk again... forget it, I'll walk.|Derek said he'd have breakfast waiting.
    Like old times.
  doorOpenLines: ...the door's open.|Derek never leaves it open.
  callOut: Derek? I'm home!
  noAnswer: ...Derek?
  bodyLines: Derek...?|No. No, no, no--|DEREK! Come on, wake up! WAKE UP!|...he's
    cold.|Who did this to you...?
  cameraIdea: The camera. He put one in the bedroom last month.|Whoever did this...
    it saw them.
  tapeStart: Playback. This morning, 06:52.
  afterTape: That mask...|He was HERE. In our home.|...wait. 06:52.|That was twenty
    minutes ago.
  footstepLines: ...footsteps.|Right behind me.
  spottedLine: YOU!
  escapedLines: The front door--!|Someone just ran out!
  upLines: He's going up!|Get back here!
  topLines: The roof... there's nothing up there.|He's trapped.
  confrontLines: Nowhere left to run.|Why him? WHY DEREK?!|"...ask your boss about
    Tomas."|Tomas...? What the hell does that--|No. I don't care.|You're going to
    pay for this.
  grabLines: He grabs my wrist--|NO--!
